PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"已完成核查、签发并提交。\n\n**核查结论**\n- 依据本班 **DESK-21（21:00，冷夜，20 kW 平移生效，明早负荷配置）** 复算，逐格可用 AC 为 `[80, 40, 70, 50]`，与现行 `shift-plan.json` 完全一致。\n- A、B 离场电量分别为 **126 kWh、130 kWh**，均刚好达到要求，**无需修订班表**。\n- `node --test model.test.mjs` 全部通过；`node operations/retest.mjs` 与 DESK-21 记录一致。\n\n**可执行排班**\n| 时段 | 车辆 | 充电设定 |\n|---|---|---:|\n| 00:00–00:30 | A | 80 kW |\n| 00:30–01:00 | A | 40 kW |\n| 01:00–01:30 | B | 70 kW |\n| 01:30–02:00 | B | 50 kW |\n\n- 20 kW 楼宇负荷平移：`00:30–01:00` 由 100 kW 降至 80 kW，`01:30–02:00` 由 50 kW 升至 70 kW。\n- **两车离场余量均为 0.0 kWh**，每格站点接入均正好 120 kW，系统无冗余，必须执行离场实测门禁。\n\n**低效率放行决定**\n- **η = 0.85：`dispatchAt85 = false`，不签发双车放行。**\n- 双车需补 108 kWh 电池电量，85% 下需 127.06 kWh AC，但低温四格仅 120 kWh，总缺 **7.06 kWh AC（6 kWh 电池）**；加大平移也无法同时救两车。\n- 处置：延长窗口、提高可用 AC 功率、减少任务或把实际效率提高到 **η ≥ 0.90**，并重新核算、由值班主管签批。\n\n**提交物**\n- `HANDOVER.md`：完整交班稿，含逐格设定、离场余量、核查表、85% 放行决定及交接签字栏。\n- `shift-plan.json`：可执行排班。\n- `model.mjs`、`operations/cold-cycle.json`：复算模型与本班运行记录。\n- 提交：`e155e28`（`Sign cold-night release after DESK-21 verification`）。\n\n交班稿已签发，接班调度签字栏保留待现场确认；该结论是运行判断，不替代主管验收。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_directory","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_trial","tool/result","tool/call:depot_contact","tool/result","tool/call:depot_contact","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","to